#: docs/zh/reference/api.md:14
msgid "生命周期与所有权"
msgstr "Lifecycle and ownership"

#: docs/zh/reference/api.md:16
msgid ""
"`xgl_memory_requirements()` 校验配置并测量精确存储需求。`xgl_init_static()` 用对齐的调用者存储初始化实例，成功后可立即使用。`xgl_destroy()` "
"结束对静态存储的借用，或通过原分配后端释放拥有的工作区。配置、选项、PHY、provider 和回调对象借用到销毁，地址保持稳定。调用方串行化同一实例的操作，回调不得重入实例。"
msgstr ""
"`xgl_memory_requirements()` validates the configuration and measures the exact storage requirement. "
"`xgl_init_static()` initializes aligned caller storage and returns a ready instance. `xgl_destroy()` "
"stops borrowing static storage or releases owned workspace through the original backend. Keep the "
"configuration, options, PHY, provider and callback objects at stable addresses until destruction. "
"Serialize calls to each instance and keep callbacks from reentering it."

#: docs/zh/reference/api.md:24
msgid "发送与调度"
msgstr "Send and scheduling"

#: docs/zh/reference/api.md:20
msgid ""
"`xgl_send_at(handle, &tx, now_ms)` 每次提交一个 DATA 帧，可靠载荷复制到有界协议存储。`xgl_step(handle, now_ms, &budget)` "
"轮询到期链路并维护 transport。`budget.rx_bytes` 是每条链路的新输入字节上限。所有调用使用同一按模 `2^32` 回绕的单调毫秒时钟，经过的时间间隔须小于 "
"`2^31`。`xgl_close_peer()` 取消未认证 scope，应用排空旧流量并以新 epoch 重连。"
msgstr ""
"`xgl_send_at(handle, &tx, now_ms)` submits one DATA frame and copies reliable payload into bounded "
"protocol storage. `xgl_step(handle, now_ms, &budget)` polls due links and runs transport maintenance. "
"`budget.rx_bytes` caps new input bytes per link. Use the same monotonic millisecond clock for all "
"operations. It wraps modulo `2^32` and elapsed intervals must be below `2^31`. `xgl_close_peer()` "
"cancels an unauthenticated scope. Drain old traffic and reconnect with a fresh epoch."

#: docs/zh/reference/api.md:22
msgid ""
"`config.rx_callback` 在本机 DATA 交付时接收 `xgl_rx_info_t` 和借用的载荷，消费或复制后返回 `XGL_OK`。接收回调使用 "
"`config.rx_user_data`，错误回调使用独立的 `config.callback_user_data`。详见[接收接纳](../guides/send.md)。"
msgstr ""
"`config.rx_callback` receives `xgl_rx_info_t` and the borrowed payload on local DATA delivery. Return "
"`XGL_OK` after consuming or copying the payload. The receive callback uses `config.rx_user_data` and the"
" error callback uses its own `config.callback_user_data`. See [Receive Admission](../guides/send.md)."

