#: docs/zh/reference/api.md:0
msgid "`<xgl/xgl_alloc.h>`"
msgstr "`<xgl/xgl_alloc.h>`"

#: docs/zh/reference/api.md:0
msgid ""
"`xgl_init_allocated()` 一次完成工作区申请和初始化，成功后实例可立即使用。传入显式 allocator，或传入 `NULL` 采用编译时 libc 策略。Full "
"默认开启回退，Embedded/Lite 默认关闭，Boot 禁止回退。"
msgstr ""
"`xgl_init_allocated()` allocates the workspace and returns a ready instance in one call. Pass an "
"explicit allocator or `NULL` to use the compiled libc policy. Full defaults to fallback enabled. "
"Embedded and Lite default to disabled, and Boot prohibits fallback."

#: docs/zh/reference/api.md:0
msgid "`<xgl/xgl_inplace.h>`"
msgstr "`<xgl/xgl_inplace.h>`"

#: docs/zh/reference/api.md:0
msgid ""
"`xgl_send_zerocopy_layout()` 查询精确头部空间和总容量；`xgl_send_zerocopy_scoped_at()` "
"在调用者存储中同步提交非可靠单帧。见[原地发送](../guides/in-place-send.md)。"
msgstr ""
"`xgl_send_zerocopy_layout()` returns exact header space and total capacity. "
"`xgl_send_zerocopy_scoped_at()` submits one unreliable frame synchronously in caller storage. See [In-"
"Place Send](../guides/in-place-send.md)."

#: docs/zh/reference/api.md:0
msgid "`<xgl/xgl_runtime.h>`"
msgstr "`<xgl/xgl_runtime.h>`"

#: docs/zh/reference/api.md:0
msgid ""
"`xgl_deadline_query()` 查询相对截止时间，可传下一次 step 的预算。`xgl_step_bounded()` 与 `config.options` "
"中的运行策略由高级运行时构建能力提供。见[低功耗运行时](../guides/low-power.md)与[扩展运行选项](../guides/advanced-runtime.md)。"
msgstr ""
"`xgl_deadline_query()` queries the relative deadline, optionally using the budget for the next step. "
"`xgl_step_bounded()` and the policy set in `config.options` require the advanced runtime build "
"capability. See [Low-Power Runtime](../guides/low-power.md) and [Advanced Runtime "
"Options](../guides/advanced-runtime.md)."

#: docs/zh/reference/api.md:0
msgid "`<xgl/xgl_security.h>`"
msgstr "`<xgl/xgl_security.h>`"

#: docs/zh/reference/api.md:0
msgid "安装或关闭可信的方向性关联。关闭时释放匹配的 transport peer，并保留 nonce 域的占用记录。见[安全](protocol/v1/security.md)。"
msgstr ""
"Install or close trusted directional associations. Closing releases the matching transport peer and "
"retains the record of used nonce domains. See [Security](protocol/v1/security.md)."

#: docs/zh/reference/api.md:0
msgid "`<xgl/xgl_diagnostics.h>`"
msgstr "`<xgl/xgl_diagnostics.h>`"

#: docs/zh/reference/api.md:0
msgid ""
"`xgl_memory_report()` 解释各资源预留，`xgl_resources_get()` 查询当前占用，`xgl_stats_get()` 与 `xgl_stats_reset()` "
"访问计数；`xgl_error_string()` 解释状态码，`xgl_version_int()` 报告链接版本。见[资源模型](../explanation/resource-"
"model.md)与[统计](statistics.md)。"
msgstr ""
"`xgl_memory_report()` describes reserved resources and `xgl_resources_get()` reports current usage. "
"`xgl_stats_get()` and `xgl_stats_reset()` access counters, `xgl_error_string()` describes status codes "
"and `xgl_version_int()` reports the linked version. See [Resource Model](../explanation/resource-"
"model.md) and [Statistics](statistics.md)."

